            None of these differences is large, but they are a reason to check the panel for peanut butter specifically. A gram of fat here and a few calories there add up if you drink two shakes a day, and the protein you get per scoop can be a few grams lower than the headline number on the brand's best-known flavor. Our guide to the <a href="/best-whey-protein-isolate/">best whey protein isolate</a> explains how to compare protein per calorie across products.
