              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                PB2 Performance has 200 calories for 22 g of protein, and Ghost's Nutter Butter about 160 calories per scoop. Both are fine choices, but they deliver less protein per calorie than an isolate, which matters if you are trying to lose weight.
              </p>
